                                        "entry_id": "ceeb3386-1c5e-3639-a04f-36e9ff44b2b9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The process of the world economy becoming dominated by capitalist models, according to the World System Theory."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0c388006-fc10-4877-a585-94fae270190f",
                                                "sense_id": "9f8adf4f-c5e1-33e4-b758-ae6f4ce54970",
                                                "text": "Sure, globalization as flows of trade will continue. But globalization as the driving logic of world affairs — that seems to be over."
                                            }
